[exclusion-03] Renaming a rating, or rewording what a rating means.
    -> keep-rating-names-and-meanings-unchanged  [compatibility/explicit]
       The change does not alter any rating names or reword what any rating means.

[exclusion-04] Running the delivered code or any test.
